{
  "key": 28362,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_YouDeserveABerry",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone seems to call me the Berry\n",
        "Master.\r",
        "I hand out Berries daily because\n",
        "I want people to learn how wonderful\f",
        "they are.\r",
        "You’re deserving of one!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Apparemment, tout le monde\n",
        "m’appelle le Maître des Baies.\r",
        "Chaque jour, je distribue des Baies\n",
        "dans l’espoir que les gens réalisent\f",
        "à quel point elles sont formidables.\r",
        "Tiens, tu la mérites!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_FeedBerriesToPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Berries are gifts of nature.\r",
        "I encourage you to feed Berries to\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "That will make Pokémon happy.\r",
        "Seeing that, people will be motivated\n",
        "to plant more Berries.\r",
        "And that will make Sinnoh a greener,\n",
        "more natural place."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les Baies sont un don de la nature.\r",
        "Je t’encourage à donner des Baies\n",
        "à tes Pokémon.\r",
        "Ça les rend heureux.\r",
        "En voyant ça, les gens auront\n",
        "envie de planter d’autres Baies.\r",
        "Ainsi, Sinnoh deviendra un lieu\n",
        "verdoyant, un gigantesque verger."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_DoYouForgetWherePlanted",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you the forgetful type who\n",
        "forgets where Berries are planted?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Es-tu du genre tête en l’air, à\n",
        "oublier où tu as planté tes Baies?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_HaveThisPoketchApp",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, yes, I thought so!\n",
        "I’m the same way!\r",
        "I feel a sort of kinship with you!\n",
        "You can have this Pokétch app!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oui, oui, je le savais!\n",
        "Je suis comme toi!\r",
        "Je me sens des affinités avec toi!\n",
        "Tiens, prends ce logiciel Pokémontre!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_OKWithoutThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, is that so.\r",
        "Then you’re OK even if I don’t give\n",
        "you this nice thing."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, vraiment.\r",
        "Dans ce cas, tu n’auras pas besoin de\n",
        "ce super truc que je voulais te donner."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_BerrySearcherShowsRipeLocations",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_1 24, 0, 0} shows you\n",
        "where there are ripe Berries\f",
        "that are ready to be picked."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le {STRVAR_1 24, 0, 0}\n",
        "t’indique les Baies mûres qui\f",
        "sont prêtes à être ramassées."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_CertainBerriesNeedLotsOfWater",
      "en_US": [
        "Certain kinds of Berries need lots\n",
        "and lots of water."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Certaines familles de Baies ont besoin\n",
        "d’être arrosées abondamment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_WouldYouLikeSomeMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "Um... Would you like some Mulch?\r",
        "If you’re going to grow Berries,\n",
        "Mulch is a good fertilizer."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum... Est-ce que tu veux du\n",
        "fertilisant?\r",
        "Si tu veux faire pousser des Baies,\n",
        "y a pas mieux comme engrais."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_MulchWillPromoteBerryGrowth",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}...\r",
        "I made it by mixing high-grade soil\n",
        "with Pokémon...um...you know...\r",
        "It will promote healthy Berry growth."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce produit, là, {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}... Tu\n",
        "sais comment je l’ai obtenu?\r",
        "En mélangeant de la bonne terre avec\n",
        "du... euh... tu-sais-quoi de Pokémon...\r",
        "Avec ça, tes Baies sont en pleine santé."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_PleaseComeAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Um...\n",
        "Please come again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum...\n",
        "N’hésite pas à revenir me voir."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_YouBoughtSomeMulch",
      "en_US": "You bought some {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\r",
      "fr_FR": "Tu as acheté du {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_YourBagAppearsToBeFull",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m so sorry...\n",
        "Your Bag appears to be full..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, quel dommage...\n",
        "On dirait bien que ton Sac est plein..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_YouDontHaveEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": [
        "Um... You don’t appear to have\n",
        "enough money..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum... On dirait que tu n’as\n",
        "pas assez d’argent..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_BookMuchAdoAboutMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a book titled “Much Ado About\n",
        "Mulch: A Berry-Grower’s Guide.”\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un livre intitulé “Engrais Sans Regret:\n",
        "Guide pour la Culture des Baies.”\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_ReadAboutWhatMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "Which kind of Mulch would\n",
        "you like to read about?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Lire quel chapitre?"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_ExplainGrowthMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "The Growth Mulch promotes faster\n",
        "growth of Berries.\r",
        "However, it also causes the soil to dry\n",
        "faster as well.\r",
        "More frequent watering is recommended.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Avec le Fertipousse, les Baies poussent\n",
        "plus vite, mais le sol s’assèche plus\f",
        "rapidement aussi.\r",
        "Conseil: arroser plus souvent.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_ExplainDampMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "The Damp Mulch slows the drying of soil.\r",
        "However, it also slows the growth of\n",
        "Berries.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le Fertihumide ralentit l’assèchement\n",
        "du sol.\r",
        "Cependant, il ralentit également la\n",
        "croissance des Baies.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_ExplainStableMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "The Stable Mulch extends the time\n",
        "Berries remain on their plants.\r",
        "Some growers use it in hard-to-reach\n",
        "locations that may be overlooked for\f",
        "harvesting.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Avec le Fertistable, les Baies tombent\n",
        "moins vite de leur plant.\r",
        "Certains l’utilisent sur les plants\n",
        "difficiles d’accès que l’on peut\f",
        "oublier de récolter.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_ExplainGooeyMulch",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gooey Mulch increases the growth\n",
        "cycles of Berries.\r",
        "This means the number of times new\n",
        "plants grow from where mature plants\f",
        "have withered is increased.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le Fertiglu accélère la croissance\n",
        "des Baies.\r",
        "On peut ainsi cueillir les Baies plus\n",
        "souvent.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_GrowthMulch",
      "en_US": "GROWTH MULCH",
      "fr_FR": "FERTIPOUSSE"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_DampMulch",
      "en_US": "DAMP MULCH",
      "fr_FR": "FERTIHUMIDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_StableMulch",
      "en_US": "STABLE MULCH",
      "fr_FR": "FERTISTABLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_GooeyMulch",
      "en_US": "GOOEY MULCH",
      "fr_FR": "FERTIGLU"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route208House_Text_Exit",
      "en_US": "EXIT",
      "fr_FR": "ANNULER"
    }
  ]
}